        <referenceFunction amount="1" category="transport systems" datasetRelatesToProduct="true" generalComment="This inventory was modelled according to information in Koller, (2019). The information on the materials refers to a concrete sleeper turnout with a total length of 40 m and a branch radius of 500 m. As there are significant differences in the lengths of the turnouts, this inventory was compiled per metre and can therefore be scaled to other lengths. The inventory contains the materials for the production of the entire structure of the turnouts with main track and branch track as well as track bed and sleepers. An approximation for the turnout drive has been added. Not included are cables for the control and heating of the points. The energy required for the construction work has not been taken into account, as this is largely already covered in the sub-inventories (track bed, sleepers, rails, etc.). &#10;Offcuts and rejects are not taken into account. The ecoinvent standard values were used for transport distances for material deliveries by lorry (Frischknecht et al., 2007).&#10;The service life of a switch is approx. 25 years. Maintenance work, refurbishment and dismantling are not taken into account.; UUID:5205ca40-42dd-3bef-97c6-71d1544da6de" includedProcesses="The inventory includes all the materials, energy and transport necessary for constructing a railway switch. Excluded are maintenance and disposal" infrastructureIncluded="true" infrastructureProcess="false" localCategory="transport systems" localName="Railway switch" localSubCategory="train\operations\infrastructure" name="Railway switch" subCategory="train\operations\infrastructure" unit="my">
